{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/04/04/5053384/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間お休みの日に\n横浜ベイサイドに行ってきたの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この風景みんな見覚えあるよね？？？♡\nあのMVのーー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"将棋フォーカス"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついに明日放送です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/04/04/5053384/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日の放送で私と一緒にMCを\nしてくださるのは\n将棋界のイケメンと言われております、\n中村太地さんです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして講座は\n佐藤康光さん、藤田綾さんが\n担当してくださいます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リニューアルして、\n将棋の本当に初歩からの内容なので、\n将棋全く分からない方も\n気軽に観ていただけると思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"放送はNHK Eテレにて\n日曜 10:00～10:30\n木曜 15:00～15:30(再)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひぜひぜひぜひ\nたくさんの方に観ていただきたいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして\n将棋の楽しさが伝わったらいいなあと\n思っています♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう！\n今日の握手会でかりん党の方が\nこんな横断幕を作ってくれてたよ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/04/04/5053384/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの方達もみんなこうやって一緒に\n喜んでくれてて\nとっても嬉しいなあ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"将棋世界 5月号 発売中です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"将棋世界のスタッフさんが\n駒の生産で有名な\n山形県天童市に行った時に\n作ってきてくれました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/04/04/5053384/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スタッフさんからの\n愛を感じるヾ(◜▿‾ ( ´▿｀ ) ‾▿◝)ﾉ♡\n嬉しい嬉しいヾ(◜▿‾ ( ´▿｀ ) ‾▿◝)ﾉ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読者応募の品もまたあるので、\nぜひぜひお求めください♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/04/04/5053384/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は取り急ぎこれだけ！\n握手会のこととか、\n畠中さんのことはまた次ね！(´｡･o･｡`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"か  り  ん  (っｴ`o)"}],"source":"archive"}